  "description": "The Iconic S is your high-speed urban sidekick—powered by the Bosch Performance Line Speed motor, it zips up to 28 mph with effortless confidence, making every commute feel like a joyride. With 120mm of plush Suntour suspension, beefy 27.5\" Supero tires, and a comfy low-step frame, this eSUV tackles potholes, gravel, and grocery runs without breaking a sweat. Style and power come together in a sleek design, backed by a 750Wh battery and clean internal cable routing.\n\nMotor and Battery\n\nMotor: Bosch Performance Line Speed Smart System, 85Nm torque, pedal-assist up to 28 mph.\n\nBattery: Bosch PowerTube 750Wh, long range on a single charge, full recharge in ~6 hours with 4A charger.\n\nSuspension and Frame\n\nFork: Suntour XCR-34 Air BOOST LOR DS, 120mm travel to soak up city bumps and off-road surprises.\n\nFrame: Lightweight and strong 6061 aluminum with internal routing; sizes: 41 / 44 / 48 / 54 cm.\n\nDrivetrain and Brakes\n\nGears: Shimano 10-speed (RD-U6000-GS) with Samox 40T crankset and 11-48T cassette—ready for speed or steep climbs.\n\nBrakes: Shimano BR-MT200 hydraulic disc brakes (203mm front / 180mm rear) for solid, all-weather stopping power.\n\nWheels and Tires\n\nRims: BULLS DDM-12 double-wall, 30mm inner width—durable and trail-capable.\n\nTires: CST CC-03 Supero All Ground 27.5\" x 2.40\", built for mixed-surface grip and smooth cruising.\n\nAdditional Features\n\nDisplay: Bosch Purion 200, compact and crystal-clear for real-time ride stats.\n\nHandlebar & Saddle: 720mm alloy handlebar with ergonomic sweep + Selle Royal saddle for all-day comfort.\n\nPedals: Wellgo C-098DU anti-slip pedals—grippy and reliable.\n\nTechnology and Design\n\nClass-3 eBike: Pedal-assist up to 28 mph—perfect for urban riders who want speed, style, and comfort.\n\nPowerful Bosch tech, long-range riding, and premium BULLS components come together in the Iconic S—your everyday ride, only faster and more fun.",
